<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>A civil action shall not lie under this article based upon an allegation that an opinion which is subjective in nature, as distinguished from a factual assertion, about an individual’s qualifications, in connection with a personnel action concerning such an individual, was not accurate, relevant, timely, or complete.</p></caml:Content>